---
system: sys-01-identity-household-access
flow_id: child-switch
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/01-identity-household-access#child-switch-adr-0011
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, IdentityService]
apis:
  - POST /v1/profile/active-child
externals: []
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - child_not_found
  - child_archived
  - not_household_member
idempotency: naturally idempotent on (user_id, child_id) — repeat call with same child_id is a no-op
retry: single retry on 5xx
timeout: 1s
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED. Lightweight active-child switch per ADR-0011 D3. Server uses active_child_id for cost-cap scoping + analytics. Client AsyncStorage persists across app restart. ~200ms expected latency.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant IdentityService

    Note over ParentApp: User taps child selector — home_hub_idle "Playing as: [Name] ▼" (ADR-0011 D4)

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/profile/active-child {child_id} and Bearer JWT
    Gateway->>Gateway: validate parent JWT — extract user_id and household_id
    Gateway->>IdentityService: forward request
    IdentityService->>IdentityService: SELECT id, status, household_id FROM children WHERE id={child_id}
    alt child_not_found
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 404 child_not_found
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 404
    else not_household_member (child.household_id != jwt.household_id)
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 403 not_household_member
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 403
    else child_archived (status = 'archived')
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 409 child_archived {child_id}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 409
    else success
        IdentityService->>IdentityService: emit analytics event {user_id, child_id, switched_at: now()} (async, non-blocking)
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 {active_child_id: child_id}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
        ParentApp->>ParentApp: AsyncStorage.setItem('activeChildId', child_id) — persists across restart (ADR-0011 D3)
    end

    Note over ParentApp,IdentityService: timeout 1s — idempotent (user_id, child_id) — analytics emit async (no impact on response latency)
